# Images build from the repository root; only what a Dockerfile copies matters, and nothing
# local or secret ever reaches the build context.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/target
# Gradle's own state and outputs from a local build of the Java plugins (apps/reporter,
# apps/progression): an image builds them again from their sources.
**/.gradle
apps/*/build
apps/progression/*/build
.git
.github
.claude
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Operator files: state, secrets, reports. Git ignores them; so must the build.
local
**/.DS_Store
*.pdf
docs
tools
infra
